Hee hee.  If you E)ngrave with a wand of polymorph, you end up with one of
several random engravings.  One possible engraving is "Y?u won t get i? up
?he ste?s".

This is a reference to a puzzle in the first adventure game, the Crowther &
Woods Colossal Cave "Adventure" (check your *NIX distribution for
/usr/games/adventure today!).  In Adventure, there is a large sparkling
gold nugget in a low room with a crude note on the wall, "You won't get it
up the steps".  The stairs back up the dome one room away are unclimbable
carrying the gold nugget.

My favorite random engraving is "A.S. ->", a clever literary reference
(if I do say so myself) to Journey to the Center of the Earth.


